Source: data sheet (Hi3520D/Hi3515A/Hi3515C user guide, 13.6 AIP_BUF_SADDR, offset 0x1008, printed page 13-17), confidence HIGH: offset, fields, access and reset compared by script with the Chinese issue 02 edition on 2026-11-11, no difference. Not verified on hardware.";

